  "stem": "先化简，再求值：\\((\\frac{x−1}{x+1}+1)÷\\frac{{x}^{3}−2{x}^{2}+x}{{x}^{2}−1}\\)，其中\\(x=\\sqrt{3}+1\\)．",
  "type": "解答题",
  "points": null,
