  "figures": [],
  "tables": [],
  "answer": "化简得 \\(\\frac{2}{x-1}\\)，代入得 \\(\\frac{2\\sqrt3}{3}\\)。",
  "given_answer": "",
  "given_solution": "",
  "given_solution_figures": [],
  "solution_steps": [
    "原式中 \\(x\\ne-1,0,1\\)。括号内通分为 \\(\\frac{2x}{x+1}\\)，除式的分子为 \\(x(x-1)^2\\)，分母为 \\((x-1)(x+1)\\)。",
    "将除法改为乘以倒数并约分，得 \\(\\frac{2}{x-1}\\)。代入 \\(x=1+\\sqrt3\\)，得 \\(\\frac{2}{\\sqrt3}=\\frac{2\\sqrt3}{3}\\)。"
  ],
  "solution_origin": "editorial_answer_and_solution",
